#: ../../data-import.rst:2
msgid "Importing data"
msgstr "导入数据"

#: ../../data-import.rst:4
msgid ""
"Orbit reads the common genomics formats directly. Drag a file onto the "
"window, or press the **Import** button in the toolbar. The format is chosen "
"by extension."
msgstr "Orbit 直接读取常见的基因组格式。把文件拖进窗口，或点工具栏的 **导入**。格式按扩展名判断。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:9
msgid "Supported formats"
msgstr "支持的格式"

#: ../../data-import.rst:15
msgid "Format"
msgstr "格式"

#: ../../data-import.rst:16
msgid "Extension"
msgstr "扩展名"

#: ../../data-import.rst:17
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../../data-import.rst:18 ../../data-import.rst:35
msgid "bigWig"
msgstr "bigWig"

#: ../../data-import.rst:19
msgid "``.bw`` ``.bigWig``"
msgstr "``.bw`` ``.bigWig``"

#: ../../data-import.rst:20
msgid "Random access, no indexing step. Best choice for signal."
msgstr "随机访问，无需建索引。信号轨道的首选。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:21 ../../data-import.rst:49
msgid "bedGraph"
msgstr "bedGraph"

#: ../../data-import.rst:22
msgid "``.bedGraph`` ``.bdg``"
msgstr "``.bedGraph`` ``.bdg``"

#: ../../data-import.rst:23
msgid "Loaded into memory; fine up to a few hundred MB."
msgstr "整份读进内存；几百 MB 以内没问题。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:24 ../../data-import.rst:55
msgid "BAM"
msgstr "BAM"

#: ../../data-import.rst:25
msgid "``.bam``"
msgstr "``.bam``"

#: ../../data-import.rst:26
msgid "Needs a ``.bai`` next to it. Coverage is computed on the fly."
msgstr "旁边必须有 ``.bai``。覆盖度是实时计算的。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:27 ../../data-import.rst:62
msgid "GTF / GFF3"
msgstr "GTF / GFF3"

#: ../../data-import.rst:28
msgid "``.gtf`` ``.gff`` ``.gff3``"
msgstr "``.gtf`` ``.gff`` ``.gff3``"

#: ../../data-import.rst:29
msgid "Becomes a gene track; UTR and CDS features are kept."
msgstr "变成一个基因轨道；UTR 和 CDS 特征都会保留。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:30 ../../data-import.rst:75
msgid "FASTA"
msgstr "FASTA"

#: ../../data-import.rst:31
msgid "``.fa`` ``.fasta``"
msgstr "``.fa`` ``.fasta``"

#: ../../data-import.rst:32
msgid ""
"Registers the file as a local sequence source for the current assembly."
msgstr "把该文件注册为当前装配的本地序列来源。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:37
msgid ""
"The recommended format. Orbit parses the index itself, so there is no "
"``bigWigToBedGraph`` step and no conversion. Multi-sample overlays work best"
" when the files share a coordinate system."
msgstr "推荐格式。Orbit 自己解析索引，不需要 ``bigWigToBedGraph`` 转换。多样本叠加时，文件之间共用坐标系效果最好。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:45
msgid ""
"The track appears immediately with autoscale on. Open its label to pin the "
"range if you want several samples to share one scale."
msgstr "轨道会立刻出现，默认自动缩放。想让多个样本共用同一量程，就打开轨道标签把范围固定下来。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:51
msgid ""
"Plain text, four columns. Convenient for small, hand-made tracks; a genome-"
"wide file will cost memory, so prefer bigWig above a few hundred megabytes."
msgstr "纯文本，四列。适合小型手工轨道；全基因组级别会吃内存，超过几百 MB 建议改用 bigWig。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:57
msgid ""
"Orbit needs both ``sample.bam`` and ``sample.bam.bai`` in the same "
"directory. Coverage is computed from the reads in the visible window only, "
"which keeps memory flat but means the first draw of a new region takes a "
"moment."
msgstr ""
"Orbit 需要 ``sample.bam`` 和 ``sample.bam.bai`` 放在同一目录。覆盖度只按可见窗口内的 reads "
"计算，内存占用平稳，代价是第一次画新区域要等一下。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:64
msgid ""
"Imported annotations become a normal gene track: expandable transcripts, "
"strand colours, labels. Transcript and CDS features are preserved, so a GTF "
"exported from StringTie or Ensembl looks the way you expect."
msgstr ""
"导入的注释会成为普通基因轨道：可展开转录本、按链着色、带标签。转录本与 CDS 特征都会保留，所以 StringTie 或 Ensembl 导出的 "
"GTF 看起来就是你预期的样子。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:70
msgid ""
"Imported annotations are not converted to the built-in binary format. They "
"are read on load, which is fine for a few hundred thousand features but "
"slower than the bundled RefSeq index."
msgstr "导入的注释不会转成内置二进制格式，而是加载时现读。几十万条特征没问题，但比内置的 RefSeq 索引慢。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:77
msgid ""
"Loading a FASTA registers it as the local sequence source for the assembly. "
"This is how you use Orbit fully offline, or work with an assembly that UCSC "
"does not host."
msgstr "载入 FASTA 会把它注册为该装配的本地序列来源。这是完全离线使用 Orbit 的办法，也适用于 UCSC 上没有的装配。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:85
msgid ""
"Large FASTA files are memory-mapped, so a 3 GB genome does not need 3 GB of "
"RAM — but the first access to a chromosome still costs a disk read."
msgstr "大 FASTA 采用内存映射，3 GB 的基因组不需要 3 GB 内存——但首次访问某条染色体仍要读一次磁盘。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:89
msgid "Where imported tracks live"
msgstr "导入的轨道存在哪"

#: ../../data-import.rst:91
msgid ""
"Imported files are referenced in place, not copied. If you move or delete "
"the original, the track breaks on the next launch. Paths are stored in the "
"session, so reopening Orbit restores the tracks you had."
msgstr "导入的文件是原地引用，不会复制。移动或删除原文件后，下次启动轨道就会失效。路径记录在会话里，重新打开 Orbit 会恢复之前的轨道。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Orbit reads the common genomics formats directly. Drag a file onto the "
#~ "window, or use *Tracks → Load from file*. The format is chosen by extension."
#~ msgstr ""
